9,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABD3tTQw","user":{"login":"solitonLynx","id":66474009,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NDc0MDA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66474009?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/solitonLynx","html_url":"https://github.com/solitonLynx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solitonLynx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solitonLynx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solitonLynx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solitonLynx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solitonLynx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solitonLynx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solitonLynx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solitonLynx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solitonLynx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-27T13:00:17Z","updated_at":"2026-05-27T13:00:17Z","body":"> Do you have the drivers updated to the latest version? (You can do that in the NVIDIA app)\n\nI just updated my NVIDIA drivers to 610.47 GameReady, and the random BSOD problem still exist. \nApart from the BSOD by igdkmdn64.sys mentioned before, another kind of BSOD by **dxgkrnl.sys** may also appear, with the same message (SYSTEM_SERVICE_EXCEPTION) and same stop code(0x0000003b).\nI think my Intel Graphics drivers are already up-to-date.\n\nThanks.\n<img width=\"736\" height=\"424\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/aaf0c09d-bcdb-4808-ba0c-ffc77c50740e\" />","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4554707779/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4554957602","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119811#issuecomment-4554957602","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119811","id":4554957602,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABD38jIg","user":{"login":"NoNormalDev","id":190293561,"node_id":"U_kgDOC1emOQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190293561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev","html_url":"https://github.com/NoNormalDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-27T13:30:06Z","updated_at":"2026-05-27T13:30:06Z","body":"The minidumps suggest that the intel drivers may be the cause, and that a memory violation was the cause of the crash.\n\nThe issue is that Godot is not a kernel driver and it cannot instantiate a BSOD by itself.\n\nHow old is your laptop? Old RAM may be the cause...\n\nI would suggest running `sfc /scannow` in the command prompt as admin (Shortcut: WIN+R, type \"cmd\", CTRL+SHIFT+ENTER), which scans for (and fixes) corrupted system files.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4554957602/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4555185903","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119811#issuecomment-4555185903","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119811","id":4555185903,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABD4Ke7w","user":{"login":"solitonLynx","id":66474009,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NDc0MDA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66474009?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/solitonLynx","html_url":"https://github.com/solitonLynx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solitonLynx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solitonLynx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solitonLynx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solitonLynx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solitonLynx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solitonLynx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solitonLynx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solitonLynx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solitonLynx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-27T13:57:09Z","updated_at":"2026-05-27T13:57:09Z","body":"> The minidumps suggest that the intel drivers may be the cause, and that a memory violation was the cause of the crash.\n> \n> The issue is that Godot is not a kernel driver and it cannot instantiate a BSOD by itself.\n> \n> How old is your laptop? Old RAM may be the cause...\n> \n> I would suggest running `sfc /scannow` in the command prompt as admin (Shortcut: WIN+R, type \"cmd\", CTRL+SHIFT+ENTER), which scans for (and fixes) corrupted system files.\n\nI bought the laptop at around August 2022(about **4 yrs** ago), the model is Acer Swift SFX14-51G. \nI replaced the screen at around early 2024 and I don't think this is related to the problem.\nAlso, programs other than Godot on my laptop, such as other PC games, didn't cause such BSOD. \nMaybe I will consider clean install Windows and check again.\n\nThanks for helping.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4555185903/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4555408318","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119811#issuecomment-4555408318","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119811","id":4555408318,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABD4YDvg","user":{"login":"solitonLynx","id":66474009,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NDc0MDA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66474009?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/solitonLynx","html_url":"https://github.com/solitonLynx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solitonLynx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solitonLynx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solitonLynx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solitonLynx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solitonLynx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solitonLynx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solitonLynx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solitonLynx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solitonLynx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-27T14:22:30Z","updated_at":"2026-05-27T14:22:30Z","body":"UPDATE: I just ran the sfc /scannow and found corrupted files:\n2026-05-27 22:13:17, 