api.github.com/users/solitonLynx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solitonLynx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solitonLynx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solitonLynx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solitonLynx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-27T23:20:45Z","updated_at":"2026-05-27T23:20:45Z","body":"UPDATE: I tried the following methods, but all failed to remove the BSOD problem.\n1. Update Bluetooth driver and Wifi Driver\n2. sfc /scannow under admin\n3. forcing d3d12(godot.exe --rendering-driver d3d12) or opengl3 (godot.exe --rendering-driver opengl3)\n4. In NVIDIA control panel, force godot executable to \"High-performance NVIDIA processor\" in **Manage 3d Settings**\n5. Changing the project from **Forward+** to **Compatibility**\n\nMaybe I'll try other methods and check.\n\nThanks for helping.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4559484594/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]